  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened Results Delivery of PSD Progr Ethio (2016-2017)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xe4;rkt resultatleverans fr&#xe5;n PSD-program Etio (2016-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett&#xe5;rigt konsultst&#xf6;d till f&#xf6;rh&#xf6;jd resultatleverans fr&#xe5;n PSD-insatser  i Etiopien. M&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen med st&#xf6;det &#xe4;r att h&#xf6;ja kapaciteten hos      svaga samarbetspartners vad g&#xe4;ller utvecklingsresultatens omfattning  och h&#xe5;llbarhet, genom inspiration och till&#xe4;mpning av aktuell          forskning och internationell erfarenhet inom verksamhetsomr&#xe5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">External consultancy support to enhanced results delivery of local    PSD-interventions, planned for one year from signature of contract.   Expected result from this support is to improve the capacity of weak  development partners, especially in the areas of results based        management and maximum outreach and sustainability of development     results, through application of research and international experience</narrative>
  </description>
